	(text "OVER/UNDER VOLTAGE LOCK POINT DESIGN (12V_UP):\n\nFrom data sheet V_{OVLO} = 1.2V V_{UVLO} = 1.2V\n\n1. V_{UVLO} = (r2 + r3) / (r1 + r2 + r3) * V_{IN(UV)} \n2. V_{OVLO} = r3 / (r1 + r2 + r3) * V_{IN(OV)}\n\nV_{OV} = 14.5V\nV_{UV} = 10.0V\n\n1%\nr1 = 10k, r2 = 1k, r3 = 1k\n\nV_{approx, OV} = 14.4V\nV_{approx, UV} = 10.3V\n\nrilm max = 464R; will give max 1.94A 845R will give 1A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
